{"articleNo":"346758","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=346758&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2022년도 제13기 사회리더 대학생 멘토링 멘티모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.02.17","hit":"47219","attachments":[{"name":"제13기 멘티 모집 공고문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=346758&attachNo=109100"},{"name":"22년도 멘티 신청 가이드.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=346758&attachNo=109101"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">년도 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">13</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">기 사회리더 대학생 멘토링</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">대학생 멘티를 모집하오니 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">1. 지원자격: 2022년 전국 대학(원) 재학생 및 휴학생 (1987.1.2.</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;이후 출생자에 한함)</span><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">2. 신청기간:</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">~ 2. 21.(월</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) 24:00 (주말/공휴일 신청 가능)</span></span></strong></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">3. 신청방법: 한국장학재단 홈페이지에서 온라인 신청</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; - 한국장학재단 홈페이지&gt;인재육성&gt;사회리더 대학생 멘토링&gt; 멘토링 신청하기(PC에서만 신청 가능)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">4. 제출서류</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">[필수서류] 재학 또는 휴학 증명서</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">[선택서류] 저소득층, 장애인, 다문화/탈북 증빙서류, 봉사활동 인증서 등</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">5. 멘티 지원사항</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">- 다양한 분야의 사회 지도층 멘토와 월 1회 이상 멘토링 활동</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">- 발대식, 리더십콘서트 등 대규모 교육 프로그램 참가</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">- 체계적 역량개발 프로그램</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">- 한국장학재단 이사장 명의 수료증 발급</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">6. 문의처 : 한국장학재단 인재육성장학부 멘토링 운영사무국(02-2259-2640~3), 한국장학재단 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">www.kosaf.go.kr</span></u></a>)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwejCEMHUBSBZAzgVwO4HEDmWCCAGivgA4ASAogJoCSA8gHQBWpOQA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
